{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36943","headline":"下第寄张坤 · 罗隐","name":"下第寄张坤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谩费精神掉五侯，破琴孤劒是身讐。\n九衢护阙拟何去，玉垒铜梁空旧游。\n蝴蝶有情牵晚梦，杜鹃无赖伴春愁。\n思量不及张公子，经岁池江倚酒楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36943.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36943","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}